s="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>9282154</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1087297A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NISHIMURA KAZUYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>WACOM ENGINEERING CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NISHIMURA, KAZUYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WACOM ENGINEERING CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NISHIMURA KAZUYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NISHIMURA, KAZUYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An operation input processing device, for example, automatic ticket machine having an operation input executing section for issuing a ticket according to the input made by the user, wherein an application program used by the operation input processing device is extracted from a software resource including application programs, the operation input executing section is made to respond by a personal computer executing the extracted application program, and thus the operation inputting device having various functions can be easily operated responsively without any damage to the executed application program.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif de traitement de saisie opérationnelle, par exemple une machine de billetterie automatique comprenant une section d'exécution de saisie opérationnelle permettant d'émettre un billet en fonction de la saisie réalisée par l'utilisateur. Ce dispositif de traitement de saisie opérationnelle utilise notamment un programme d'application extrait d'une ressource logicielle comprenant plusieurs programmes d'application, ladite section d'exécution de saisie opérationnelle étant conçue pour répondre à un ordinateur personnel exécutant ce programme d'application extrait. Ainsi, le dispositif de saisie opérationnelle susmentionné, doté de diverses fonctions, peut être facilement utilisé en conséquence, et ce sans que le programme d'application exécuté ne soit endommagé.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>